{"4522210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Junkyard Stories: Rebirth", "steam_appid": 4522210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522210/extras/194924264957dd251dd82496f420561a.poster.avif?t=1787127115\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522210/extras/194924264957dd251dd82496f420561a.webm?t=1787127115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522210/extras/194924264957dd251dd82496f420561a.mp4?t=1787127115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">You're a discarded robot, carrying the consciousness of a legendary hacker.   <br>   <br>During your journey, every decision counts: your battery drains constantly, resources are scarce, and enemies lurk among ruins shaped by floods, ruptures, and war-damage.   <br>   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>WHILE THE DEMO PRESENTS BASIC FEATURES:</u></strong>  <br>   </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HACK &amp; MANIPULATE:</strong> Switch between the robot and companion to hack circuits, create distractions, and activate platforms.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522210/extras/0adb73749b8c910692d750f7b700a185.poster.avif?t=1787127115\" width=1000 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522210/extras/0adb73749b8c910692d750f7b700a185.webm?t=1787127115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522210/extras/0adb73749b8c910692d750f7b700a185.mp4?t=1787127115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STEALTH AND DYNAMIC INTERRACTIONS:</strong> Sneak past guards, evade surveillance drones,  outsmart enemies, pickpocket, and create distractions with clever planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522210/extras/7514e7015dcb75eb7201acf4e00e5ecc.poster.avif?t=1787127115\" width=1000 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522210/extras/7514e7015dcb75eb7201acf4e00e5ecc.webm?t=1787127115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522210/extras/7514e7015dcb75eb7201acf4e00e5ecc.mp4?t=1787127115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE FULL GAME EXPANDS THEM WITH:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CINEMATIC STORYWORLD:</strong> Unravel a dystopian narrative through exploration, puzzles, and environmental storytelling. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522210/extras/96557233ca0420e0fad718a5d2f18dd0.poster.avif?t=1787127115\" width=1000 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522210/extras/96557233ca0420e0fad718a5d2f18dd0.webm?t=1787127115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522210/extras/96557233ca0420e0fad718a5d2f18dd0.mp4?t=1787127115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCAVANGE AND TRADE:</strong> Defeat odd creatures,<i> collect Non-Terrestrial Artifacts that enhance your abilities, and interact with NPCs to trade and gain advantages. </i>Keep your battery charged, repair damage, and scavenge resources in a hostile, unpredictable world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522210/extras/cd22ec261afbab9fc898d8de61fdcc19.poster.avif?t=1787127115\" width=1000 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522210/extras/cd22ec261afbab9fc898d8de61fdcc19.webm?t=1787127115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522210/extras/cd22ec261afbab9fc898d8de61fdcc19.mp4?t=1787127115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEMORY COLLECTION:</strong> Discover and collect discarded items that restore memory fragments. Each item ignites lost memories of the hacker’s life, letting you uncover secrets about the world and revisit them in your inventory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522210/extras/194924264957dd251dd82496f420561a.poster.avif?t=1787127115\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522210/extras/194924